    "AlertId": "118318",
    "Headline": "Bus Substitution Between Jefferson Park and Harlem (O’Hare branch) Stations",
    "ShortDescription": "Shuttle buses will replace Blue Line service between Jefferson Park and Harlem (O’Hare branch).",
    "FullDescription": {
      "#cdata-section": "<div class=\"responsive-table\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">How does this affect my trip?</span><br />\r\nShuttle buses will replace rail service between Jefferson Park and Harlem (O&rsquo;Hare branch).</div>\r\n\r\n<p>Trains will operate between O&rsquo;Hare and Harlem (O&rsquo;Hare branch), and between Jefferson Park, downtown, and Forest Park.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Allow extra travel time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Why is service being changed?</span><br />\r\nCTA is performing track maintenance for a safer, smoother commute. This work is funded via the Northern Illinois Transit Authority (NITA) Act.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"responsive-table\">\r\n<table>\r\n\t<caption><span style=\"font-weight: bolder; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 19.2px;\">Bus shuttle boarding locations</span></caption>\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Station</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Direction</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Shuttle stop</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody style=\"vertical-align:top;\">\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Jefferson Park</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>to Harlem</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>in bus terminal, at stop (A)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"row\">Harlem</th>\r\n\t\t\t<td>to Jefferson Park</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>in bus terminal, south bays near Harlem Ave</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n"
    },
